cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "fastatacular: A pure-Python library for reading and writing FASTA sequence files"
abstract: >-
  fastatacular is a pure-Python library for reading and writing FASTA
  sequence files. It parses standard FASTA records into structured
  SequenceEntry objects and supports optional parsing of UniProt-style
  description keys (OS=, OX=, GN=, PE=, SV=) and pipe-delimited identifiers
  such as sp|P12345|EX_HUMAN and gi|12345|ref|NP_000001.1|. It is the
  plain-FASTA companion to pefftacular, sharing the same read/write API
  shape, and is intended for proteomics and genomics pipelines that need
  lightweight, dependency-free FASTA parsing. It requires Python 3.12 or
  later.
version: "0.1.3"
